note p10_profile: annotations read by the critical source profile seed/profile/profile.om
note (omega-mv #1063, pending). omc treats them as notes; the profile enforces them:
note "note p10 pure" (no put, pure callees only), "note p10 effect" (host words allowed),
note bounded while (bound <= 8192) and every assigned call result read before it is lost.
global ob uchar 24
note p10 pure
fn sq v ulong to ulong
ret mul v v
end
note p10 effect
fn outu v ulong to ulong
i = ulong 23
put ob 23 10
n = v
while true bound 20
i = sub i 1
put ob i uchar add rem n 10 48
n = div n 10
if eq n 0
break
end
end
w = write 1 ob i sub 24 i
if ne w long sub 24 i
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
for k ulong 10
s = add s sq k
end
e = outu s
if ne e 0
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
